From 52e3a0335af9ec97f33bdd7fea4135d22e917184 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:09:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Technique labels: element names cropped to their letters,
 panel labels before the arrow
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

French, German, Italian and Catalan: each element name's crop is its letters at the right edge of its cell, so the
left column ends against the grid and the right column centres a name as it centres the originals (NATUR stood out to
the left, LUFT and MECHA were squeezed into cells too narrow). The technique panel's labels start at the panel's x and
stop where the arrow starts; the arrow and the values take Spanish's x, the room POTÈNCIA, POTENZA and EFFETTO need,
and MP sits on its arrow's middle row as the other labels do.
---
 src/main/game_menu.c | 133 ++++++++++++++++++++++---------------------
 1 file changed, 68 insertions(+), 65 deletions(-)

